  "description": "*“You said you wanted to see it. I guess there’s no reason not to. I’ll show you.”*\n\n*“Lie down. I’ll take good care of you.”*\n\nLee Yeo-Reum, a 26-year-old new to the workforce, has a crush on her team leader, Seok Do-Jun. While she was masturbating alone, picturing his face, Team Leader Seok caught her red-handed. \n\n*“Show me yours too, Team Leader. That’s only fair!”\n\n“Ha… Are you crazy?”*\n\nBut… things are taking a strange turn? \n\n *“You said you wanted to see it. I guess there’s no reason not to. I’ll show you.”* \n\nA pretty face, but… not so pretty on the inside. Seok Do-Jun whispered like a devil with an angelic face. She tried to use him, but ended up being used herself.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
